{
  "Npcs.RiddleDemon.Desc": "You are fighting an aged wretch of a demon. His muscles bulge unnaturally beneath his shabby clothes, and he moves with a speed you wouldn't expect at all from him. Every time your eyes slip off of him for even a second, the devil rushes at you with uncanny alacrity, making this fight a harrowing experience."
  "Npcs.RiddleDemon.Name": "old demon"
}
